  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "For the cultivation of C. necator the following growth media were used: Luria Broth (LB): 5 g L−1 yeast extract, 10 g L−1 triptone and 5 g L−1 NaCl in deionized water, pH was set to 7.0 with NaOH and HCl."
    },
    {
